Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: Asgard base system miscellaneous files
 This package contains the basic filesystem hierarchy of an Asgard system,
 and several important miscellaneous files, such as /etc/debian_version
 (preserved upstream filename for tool compatibility), /etc/host.conf,
 /etc/issue, /etc/motd, /etc/profile, and others, plus the text of several
 common licenses in use on Asgard systems.
 .
 Forked from Debian's base-files (12.4+deb12u14) by Athena Linux at
 fork/source/base-files/.  Re-merge against upstream on every security
 release; see XSBC-Original-Maintainer field for the upstream maintainer
 to track for changes.
